<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Aventra — Bespoke International Travel & Quote Calculator</title>
  
  <!-- Google Fonts: Fraunces & Inter -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            'main-dark': '#0a0d12',
            'card-dark': '#1a1f29',
            'card-inner': '#141820',
            'gold': '#c9a24a',
            'gold-bright': '#e2bd6a',
            'gold-soft': 'rgba(201,162,74,0.14)',
            'teal': '#5b8a80',
            'teal-soft': 'rgba(91,138,128,0.16)',
          },
          fontFamily: {
            serif: ['Fraunces', 'serif'],
            sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --main-dark: #0a0d12;
      --card-dark: #1a1f29;
      --card-inner: #141820;
      --border-light: rgba(238,231,213,0.1);
      --border-strong: rgba(238,231,213,0.22);
      --text-main: #efe7d5;
      --text-dim: #a89f8c;
      --gold: #c9a24a;
      --gold-bright: #e2bd6a;
      --gold-soft: rgba(201,162,74,0.14);
      --teal: #5b8a80;
      --teal-soft: rgba(91,138,128,0.16);
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--main-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-serif {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    }

    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 8px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #0a0d12;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #2a3342;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #c9a24a;
    }

    /* Custom Radio & Checkbox Cards styling */
    .dest-radio:checked + label,
    .option-radio:checked + label,
    .check-input:checked + label {
      border-color: #c9a24a;
      background-color: rgba(201,162,74,0.12);
    }
    .check-input:checked + label .check-box {
      background-color: #c9a24a;
      border-color: #c9a24a;
      color: #0a0d12;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="selection:bg-gold selection:text-black">

  <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 flex justify-between items-center px-6 md:px-12 py-4 bg-[#0a0d12]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-[#efe7d5]/10">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gold rotate-45"></div>
      <span class="text-lg font-serif font-bold tracking-wider">Aventra</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-[#a89f8c]">
      <a href="#about" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">About Us</a>
      <a href="#destinations" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">40+ Destinations</a>
      <a href="#calculator" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Quote Calculator</a>
      <a href="#testimonials" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a href="#calculator" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-gold text-black font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider rounded-lg hover:bg-gold-bright transition-all shadow-lg shadow-gold/10">Plan Journey</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="relative text-center py-24 md:py-36 px-6 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10,13,18,0.75), rgba(10,13,18,0.92)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488646953014-85cb44e25828?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=85');">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-gold-soft text-gold-bright border border-gold/30 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">
        Global Luxury Bespoke Travel
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-serif font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
        Plan Your Aventra International Journey
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#a89f8c] mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Curated elite international expeditions, VIP door-to-door chauffeurs, private aviation, and hand-selected five-star sanctuaries across 40+ premier global destinations.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#calculator" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-black font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase rounded-xl hover:bg-gold-bright transition-all shadow-xl shadow-gold/20">
          Launch Quote Calculator
        </a>
        <a href="#destinations" class="px-8 py-4 bg-card-dark text-[#efe7d5] border border-white/10 font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase rounded-xl hover:border-gold/50 transition-all">
          Explore 40+ Destinations
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="about" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16">
      <div>
        <span class="text-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">The Aventra Standard</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mt-2 mb-6">Redefining International Luxury Travel</h2>
        <p class="text-[#a89f8c] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          At Aventra, we believe international travel should be an effortless masterpiece. From the moment our uniformed chauffeur picks you up from your front door to your return flight, every detail is orchestrated by dedicated elite concierges.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-card-dark border border-white/5 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="text-gold font-serif text-lg font-bold mb-1">Door-to-Door</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#a89f8c]">Home-to-home luxury Mercedes/BMW chauffeured transfers included.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-card-dark border border-white/5 rounded-xl">
            <h4 class="text-gold font-serif text-lg font-bold mb-1">24/7 Concierge</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#a89f8c]">Dedicated personal trip curator available round-the-clock.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl h-96">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Luxury Travel Experience" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-card-dark border border-gold/40 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl hidden sm:block">
          <span class="block text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-gold">99.4%</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#a89f8c] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Client Satisfaction</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Numbers / Stats Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-1">15,000+</span>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a89f8c]">Happy Travelers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-1">40+</span>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a89f8c]">Global Destinations</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-1">100%</span>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a89f8c]">Bespoke Itineraries</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-1">24/7</span>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a89f8c]">Global Assistance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="destinations" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="text-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Global Portfolio</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mt-2">40+ International Touring Destinations</h2>
      <p class="text-[#a89f8c] text-sm mt-2 max-w-xl mx-auto">Explore hand-picked luxury destinations across Europe, Asia, the Americas, Middle East, and Oceania.</p>
      
      <!-- Region Filter Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-8">
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('all')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-gold text-black text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition-all" data-region="all">All (40+)</button>
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('Europe')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-card-dark border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-gold transition-all" data-region="Europe">Europe</button>
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('Asia')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-card-dark border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-gold transition-all" data-region="Asia">Asia</button>
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('Americas')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-card-dark border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-gold transition-all" data-region="Americas">Americas</button>
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('Middle East')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-card-dark border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-gold transition-all" data-region="Middle East">Middle East</button>
        <button onclick="filterDestinations('Oceania')" class="region-btn px-4 py-2 bg-card-dark border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg hover:border-gold transition-all" data-region="Oceania">Oceania & Africa</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Destinations Grid (Dynamic JavaScript Population) -->
    <div id="destinationsGrid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Injected via script -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="calculator" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="text-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Bespoke Pricing Engine</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mt-2">Custom International Travel Quote Calculator</h2>
      <p class="text-[#a89f8c] text-sm mt-2">Design your journey with live cost calculation and instant reservation.</p>
    </div>

    <form id="quoteForm" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); submitBooking();" class="bg-card-dark border border-white/15 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-2xl">
      
      {/* STEP 1: DESTINATION */}
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm">01.</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Select International Destination</h3>
        </div>
        <div id="calcDestGrid" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto p-1">
          <!-- Populated by JS -->
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* STEP 2: TRAVELERS & DATES */}
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm">02.</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Schedule & Travelers</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Departure Date</label>
            <input type="date" id="depDate" required class="w-full bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:border-gold outline-none">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Number of Travelers</label>
            <input type="number" id="travelersCount" min="1" value="2" required class="w-full bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:border-gold outline-none" oninput="calculateTotal()">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* STEP 3: HOTEL TIER */}
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm">03.</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Accommodation Standard</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          
          <input type="radio" name="hotel" id="h_3star" value="3star" data-mult="1.0" data-name="3-Star Standard" class="hidden option-radio" checked onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="h_3star" class="bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-white/30 block">
            <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-sm">3-Star</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c] mt-1">Standard Comfort</span>
          </label>

          <input type="radio" name="hotel" id="h_4star" value="4star" data-mult="1.3" data-name="4-Star Premium" class="hidden option-radio" onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="h_4star" class="bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-white/30 block">
            <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-sm">4-Star</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c] mt-1">Premium Amenities</span>
          </label>

          <input type="radio" name="hotel" id="h_5star" value="5star" data-mult="1.7" data-name="5-Star Luxury" class="hidden option-radio" onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="h_5star" class="bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-white/30 block">
            <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-sm">5-Star</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c] mt-1">Grand Luxury</span>
          </label>

          <input type="radio" name="hotel" id="h_villa" value="villa" data-mult="2.2" data-name="Private Resort Villa" class="hidden option-radio" onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="h_villa" class="bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-white/30 block">
            <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-sm">Resort Villa</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c] mt-1">Ultimate Private Estate</span>
          </label>

        </div>
      </div>

      {/* STEP 4: LUXURY PERKS & ADD-ONS */}
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-gold font-bold text-sm">04.</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Bespoke Perks & Add-Ons</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          
          <input type="checkbox" id="addon_chauffeur" data-price="4500" class="hidden check-input" checked onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="addon_chauffeur" class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30 transition-all">
            <div class="check-box w-5 h-5 border border-white/30 rounded flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></div>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-semibold text-xs">Home-to-Home VIP Chauffeur Pickup</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c]">Mercedes/BMW door-to-door transfer (+₹4,500)</span>
            </div>
          </label>

          <input type="checkbox" id="addon_flights" data-price="18000" class="hidden check-input" checked onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="addon_flights" class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30 transition-all">
            <div class="check-box w-5 h-5 border border-white/30 rounded flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></div>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-semibold text-xs">International Business/Eco Flights</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c]">Roundtrip airfare coordination (+₹18,000)</span>
            </div>
          </label>

          <input type="checkbox" id="addon_visa" data-price="5000" class="hidden check-input" checked onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="addon_visa" class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30 transition-all">
            <div class="check-box w-5 h-5 border border-white/30 rounded flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></div>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-semibold text-xs">Priority Visa Processing Support</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c]">Express documentation & filing (+₹5,000)</span>
            </div>
          </label>

          <input type="checkbox" id="addon_butler" data-price="8000" class="hidden check-input" onchange="calculateTotal()">
          <label for="addon_butler" class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:border-white/30 transition-all">
            <div class="check-box w-5 h-5 border border-white/30 rounded flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></div>
            <div>
              <span class="block font-semibold text-xs">Personal Private Butler & Guide</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-[#a89f8c]">Dedicated on-trip companion (+₹8,000)</span>
            </div>
          </label>

        </div>
      </div>

      {/* SUMMARY BOX */}
      <div class="bg-[#05070a] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#a89f8c] mb-3">
          <span>Selected Destination:</span>
          <span id="sumDestText" class="font-semibold text-white">Paris, France</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#a89f8c] mb-3">
          <span>Accommodation Tier:</span>
          <span id="sumHotelText" class="font-semibold text-white">3-Star Standard</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#a89f8c] mb-3">
          <span>Travelers & Add-ons:</span>
          <span id="sumPerksText" class="font-semibold text-white">2 Travelers + Home Chauffeur + Flights</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-dashed border-white/10 pt-4 mt-4 flex justify-between items-center">
          <span class="font-serif font-bold text-base">Estimated Total Quote</span>
          <span id="totalPrice" class="font-serif font-bold text-3xl text-gold-bright">₹1,42,000</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SUBMIT BUTTON -->
      <button type="submit" id="submitBtnText" class="w-full py-4 bg-gold text-black font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-xl hover:bg-gold-bright transition-all shadow-xl shadow-gold/20">
        Confirm & Reserve Paris Journey
      </button>

    </form>
  </section>

  <section id="testimonials" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="text-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Testimonials</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mt-2">What Global Travelers Say</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <p class="text-sm text-[#a89f8c] leading-relaxed mb-6">"The home-to-home chauffeur pickup was an absolute game changer! No airport stress, and our luxury resort in Bali was breathtaking. Aventra handled every single visa and flight seamlessly."</p>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-white">Aarav & Meera Sharma</h4>
          <span class="text-xs text-gold">Bali Luxury Tour</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <p class="text-sm text-[#a89f8c] leading-relaxed mb-6">"We toured 3 European cities with Aventra. The private guides and 5-star hotels exceeded all expectations. Their 24/7 concierge was always just a WhatsApp message away."</p>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-white">Vikram Malhotra</h4>
          <span class="text-xs text-gold">European Grand Tour</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between">
        <p class="text-sm text-[#a89f8c] leading-relaxed mb-6">"From Tokyo to Kyoto, every bullet train ticket, private transfer, and Michelin-star dinner reservation was flawlessly orchestrated. Truly world-class luxury."</p>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-white">Natasha & Rohan K.</h4>
          <span class="text-xs text-gold">Japan Cultural Expedition</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-gold font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Connect With Us</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mt-2">Speak With a Luxury Travel Curator</h2>
    </div>

    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); showSuccessModal('Inquiry Received', 'Our senior travel curator will reach out to you within 2 hours.');" class="bg-card-dark border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-8 space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" required placeholder="e.g. Siddharth Roy" class="w-full bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:border-gold outline-none">
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" required placeholder="name@example.com" class="w-full bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:border-gold outline-none">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Phone Number</label>
          <input type="text" required placeholder="+91 98765 43210" class="w-full bg-card-inner border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm focus:border-gold outline-none">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-[#a89f8c] uppercase mb-2">Dream Destination or Vision</label>
